          <Label>Description</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>Traffic between {source.Name} and {target.Name} crosses a trust boundary without integrity protection, so an attacker in the path could modify values, commands or responses without detection.</Value>
