        <ThreatMetaDatum>
          <Name>PossibleMitigations</Name>
          <Label>Possible Mitigation(s)</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>Use protocol security with message integrity (OPC UA Sign/SignAndEncrypt, CIP Security, DNP3-SA, IEC 62351, TLS). Where the protocol cannot be secured, tunnel it through an authenticated, integrity-protected conduit (IPsec/TLS) and restrict paths at the zone boundary.</Value>
          </Values>
