          <Name>PossibleMitigations</Name>
          <Label>Possible Mitigation(s)</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>Encrypt flows that cross zone boundaries where confidentiality is required (TLS, OPC UA SignAndEncrypt, IPsec tunnels). Classify data to decide where encryption is needed. Do not send credentials over unencrypted channels.</Value>
          </Values>
